    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present No. 75 The Cotswolds to the market.\r\nThis property is a bright and spacious 3 bed, 3-bathroom semi-detached home built in 1999. At its heart is a generous kitchen/dining area with a fully fitted Chris Keating kitchen and island unit, opening directly onto the rear garden. The rear garden is very private and attractively landscaped, with a patio area stepping up to a lawn, ideal for relaxing outdoors and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe location of this property is superb; The Cotswolds is a popular, established, family orientated residential area within walking distance of Midleton town centre providing all essential and social amenities, while also adjacent to the N25. The property also enjoys easy access to the new Midleton Greenway, perfect for walking, cycling, and enjoying the outdoors right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of: Entrance Hall, Guest WC, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining Area, Utility Room, 3 Bedrooms (1 ensuite), and Family Bathroom. (C. 116.48 sq. m / 1,254 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €375,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\t\t\t\r\nEntrance Hall:\tSpacious entrance hallway with laminate flooring and covered radiator, leading to the sitting room.\r\n\r\nGuest toilet:\t\tWHB, WC and vinyl flooring.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:                  Front aspect with stove set in the fireplace and carpet flooring.\t\r\n\r\nKitchen/\t\r\nDining Area:\tSpacious kitchen/dining area with fully fitted Chris Keating kitchen and island unit. Integrated fridge/freezer, hob, double oven and dishwasher. Laminate flooring. Direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\t\r\nUtility Area:  \t\tTiled, plumbed for washer/dryer. Side door giving access to the garden.\r\nUpstairs:  \t\t \r\nMaster Bedroom:\tFront aspect with storage and laminate flooring.\t \r\n\r\nEn-suite:   \t\tShower, WC and WHB. Fully tiled with laminate flooring.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 2:\tDouble bedroom to the rear with laminate flooring.\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 3:\tSingle bedroom to the rear aspect with laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nFamily\t\r\nBathroom:\tTiled, with WHB, WC and shower. Renovated c. 2022.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nFront: \t\t\tOff-street parking in driveway.\r\nRear Garden: \tVery private, landscaped rear garden with patio area stepping up to a lawn. Steeltech shed. Outdoor taps and sockets."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tGas fired central heating, zoned.\r\n•\tFibre broadband available.\r\n•\tWired for PhoneWatch alarm.\r\n•\tOutdoor taps and sockets.\r\n•\tStira to attic, partially floored.\r\n•\tSteeltech shed included in sale.\r\n•\tBER C1   BER No. 108776980\r\n•\tWithin walking distance of a wonderful selection of amenities in Midleton including schools, shops, restaurants etc.\r\n•\tEasy access to the N25."
      },
